{"_id":"myyQZS2Eu4LWUd8J","name":"Move Program","type":"Program","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Move to the next node. Sometimes the matrix makes this difficult and a skill roll must be made to successfully navigate to the next node.</p><p>Resource cost by rating: 1: 10, 2: 19, 3: 22, 4: 25, 5: 30, 6: 40. Compromise programs cost 1.25x and Attack programs 1.5x (p169). A program's rating cannot exceed its deck's quality.</p>","programType":{"value":"Move"},"rating":1,"resourceCost":10},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1000,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"gvm0DCCnH59gMJJv","name":"Attack Program","type":"Program","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"<p>ICE is present and must be defeated. Usually causing damage up to and possibly including death!</p><p>Resource cost by rating: 1: 10, 2: 19, 3: 22, 4: 25, 5: 30, 6: 40. Compromise programs cost 1.25x and Attack programs 1.5x (p169). A program's rating cannot exceed its deck's quality.</p>","programType":{"value":"Attack"},"rating":1,"resourceCost":15},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
